# --- python ---
__pycache__/
# NOTE: backend/.boot_pin_cache.json is intentionally TRACKED (shipped) so fresh clones / operator
#       launches skip the design-pin settle (now ~4 min). It auto-regenerates on any edit to the keyed
#       source files (main.py/steam_system.py/reactor.py/controllers.py/thermo_extended_uniquac.py/
#       consequence.py/vle_nh3co2h2o.py); regenerate + commit it after such edits, else the first
#       launch eats one settle (still correct).
# NOTE: backend/.vle_nh3co2h2o_grid.json is TRACKED for the same reason -- it is the Extended UNIQUAC
#       activity table, ~30 s of speciation solves, keyed on props_nh3co2h2o.py + the node grid.
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv/
venv/
env/

